<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />

  <meta
    name="viewport"
    content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
  />

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="EGA AI Developer Course Lesson 6: Prompt and Context Engineering Recommendations"
  />

  <title>
    Lesson 6: Prompt and Context Engineering Recommendations | EGA
  </title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #123b69;
      --secondary: #1f6f8b;
      --accent: #f4b942;
      --success: #18794e;
      --danger: #b42318;
      --light: #f4f8fc;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --dark: #17202a;
      --muted: #5b6573;
      --border: #d6e1ea;
      --code: #101820;
      --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(18, 59, 105, 0.12);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family:
        Arial,
        Helvetica,
        sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--dark);
      background: var(--light);
    }

    header {
      padding: 34px 20px;
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          var(--primary),
          var(--secondary)
        );
    }

    .logo {
      width: min(320px, 82vw);
      height: auto;
      margin: 0 auto 18px;
      display: block;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18));
    }

    .motto {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    header h1 {
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: 0 auto 12px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    header p {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 8px auto;
      font-size: 1.06rem;
    }

    nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
    }

    nav a {
      padding: 8px 11px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.91rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    nav a:hover,
    nav a:focus {
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--primary);
    }

    main {
      width: min(1100px, 92%);
      margin: 30px auto;
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--white);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      padding-bottom: 9px;
      color: var(--primary);
      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent);
    }

    h3 {
      color: var(--secondary);
    }

    h4 {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    p {
      margin: 10px 0;
    }

    ul li,
    ol li {
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }

    .lesson-info {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns:
        repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .info-card,
    .recommendation-card,
    .example-card,
    .activity-card,
    .question {
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fbfdff;
    }

    .info-card strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .recommendation-grid,
    .example-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns:
        repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .recommendation-card {
      border-top: 5px solid var(--secondary);
    }

    .number {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--primary);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .important,
    .warning,
    .success {
      margin: 18px 0;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .important {
      border-left: 6px solid var(--accent);
      background: #fff8e7;
    }

    .warning {
      border-left: 6px solid var(--danger);
      background: #fff2f0;
    }

    .success {
      border-left: 6px solid var(--success);
      background: #eefaf4;
    }

    .somali {
      border-left: 7px solid var(--success);
    }

    .gal {
      border-left: 7px solid var(--accent);
    }

    .bad {
      border-top: 5px solid var(--danger);
    }

    .good {
      border-top: 5px solid var(--success);
    }

    .label {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .label-bad {
      background: var(--danger);
    }

    .label-good {
      background: var(--success);
    }

    pre {
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin: 14px 0;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--code);
      color: #f8f8f2;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-wrap: break-word;
      font-family:
        "Courier New",
        monospace;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    code {
      font-family:
        "Courier New",
        monospace;
    }

    .browser-output {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 16px;
      border: 2px dashed var(--secondary);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .table-wrapper {
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 16px;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }

    th,
    td {
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    th {
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--primary);
    }

    tr:nth-child(even) {
      background: #f5f9fc;
    }

    .steps {
      counter-reset: lesson-step;
      padding-left: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .steps li {
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      padding: 16px 16px 16px 66px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fbfdff;
    }

    .steps li::before {
      counter-increment: lesson-step;
      content: counter(lesson-step);
      position: absolute;
      left: 16px;
      top: 14px;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--primary);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .question {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .question p {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .question label {
      display: block;
      margin: 8px 0;
      padding: 8px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .question label:hover {
      background: #edf5fa;
    }

    details {
      margin: 12px 0;
      padding: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fbfdff;
    }

    summary {
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .answer {
      color: var(--success);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .remember {
      color: var(--white);
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          var(--primary),
          var(--secondary)
        );
    }

    .remember h2,
    .remember h3 {
      color: var(--white);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 30px 20px;
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
      background: #0c2947;
    }

    footer p {
      margin: 6px 0;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      section {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      nav {
        position: static;
      }

      th,
      td {
        min-width: 155px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header id="top">
    <img
      src="/ega-logo.png"
      class="logo"
      alt="Elmi Guray Academy official logo"
    />

    <p class="motto">
      KNOWLEDGE • INTEGRITY • OPPORTUNITY
    </p>

    <h1>
      Lesson 6: Prompt and Context Engineering Recommendations
    </h1>

    <p>
      Learn how to write focused prompts, provide useful context,
      plan before prompting, and guide AI tools effectively.
    </p>

    <p>
      Baro sida loo qoro prompt cad, loo bixiyo context muhiim ah,
      loo qorsheeyo hawsha, loona hago qalabka AI.
    </p>
  </header>

  <nav aria-label="Lesson navigation">
    <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
    <a href="#english">English Technical</a>
    <a href="#somali">Somali Farsamo</a>
    <a href="#comparison">Examples</a>
    <a href="#gal-english">GAL English</a>
    <a href="#gal-somali">GAL Somali</a>
    <a href="#html-tags">HTML Tags</a>
    <a href="#practice">Practice</a>
